      "id": "prfaq-142",
      "epicId": "bill-142",
      "headline": "API customers now pay for what they use, and can see it as they go",
      "subhead": "Usage pricing replaces the flat monthly fee, with fair charges when you change plan and no surprise jumps for existing customers.",
      "problem": "Every customer pays the same flat fee today. Heavy users underpay, light users leave, and 9 of 40 surveyed customers say they were overcharged after upgrading.",
      "whatChanges": "Customers are billed monthly for the calls they make. Plan changes are charged by the day. Existing flat-fee accounts are capped at today's fee while they move over.",
      "customerQuoteExcerptId": "ex-acme-1432",
      "successMeasure": "Billing disputes halve within two billing cycles, with no rise in churn among flat-fee accounts. Baseline: 47 disputes per 90 days.",
      "state": "draft",
